msgctxt "92"
msgid "How could Kanda do that to Kashiwagi-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "You're not planning on going after the Nishikiyama Family, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Fourth Chairman! Welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "We don't know that it was the Nishikiyama Family. Don't jump the gun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"But it's just gotta be Kanda! I never really liked him in the first place. "
"I mean, the guy swiped our territory right out from under us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"The boss let it slide because he didn't want any trouble between the "
"families, and this is how that pig repays him!? I'll kill him for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Leave this to me. I don't want you running off and making a fool out of "
"yourself. Kashiwagi-san wouldn't have wanted it, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "...Understood. Still, I'll never forgive Kanda for what he did!"
msgstr ""

